pilot-link-opt -- Palm Handheld Glue

A more recent version of pilot-link than ships with Slackware v15.
Installs to  /opt/pilot-link

pilot-link provides libraries and userspace tools for communication with
Palm handhelds.

Used by jpilot and others.

pilot-link was originally written by Kenneth Albanowski
<kjahds@kjahds.com> and others and is maintained by David Desrosiers.
